  battlefield A: "Chandra, Flame's Fury" with 8 loyalty, "Craw Wurm"
  battlefield B: "Serra Angel"
  start turn 1 A precombat_main
  turn 1 A: activate "Chandra, Flame's Fury" ability 3 targeting player B
